#title[Blueprint and Undo]

*Note: the blueprint and undo features originate from the #link("https://github.com/age77/openttd-15.3-blueprint")[OpenTTD Blueprint patch]; px-patch is based on this patch, with feature improvements.*

= Blueprint

The blueprint feature allows you to quickly copy your infrastructure, such as stations, without tedious and repetitive construction

#figure(
  image("../../static/images/bluepoint.png", width: 80%),
)

= Undo

In the undo panel, you can undo (remove) your most recent construction actions, and view the recent construction history

#figure(
  image("../../static/images/undo.png", width: 80%),
)

_Note: the construction of custom airports cannot be undone_
